# The build runs on Linux in CI and on Windows locally. Normalising to LF in
# the repository keeps those two from producing diffs that are nothing but
# line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated, and large. Collapsed in diffs and excluded from language stats so
# the repo reads as what it is rather than as one enormous JSON file.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff

# The extracted report bodies are moved code, not authored code. Marking them
# keeps GitHub's language breakdown honest about what is actually maintained
# here by hand.
reports/*/*.legacy.js linguist-vendored=true
